{"overview":{"Symbol":"PTRN","Name":"Pattern Group Inc.","Description":"Pattern Group Inc. operates as an e-commerce accelerator that combines proprietary technology and on-demand expertise to support consumer brands operating across e-commerce marketplaces in the United States and internationally. The company acquires inventory from brand partners to sell to consumers in various industries, including health and wellness; beauty and personal care; home and lifestyle; pet; sports and outdoors; and consumer electronics. The company was formerly known as Covalent Group, Inc. and changed its name to Pattern Group Inc. in November 2024. Pattern Group Inc. was incorporated in 2018 and is headquartered in Lehi, Utah.","CIK":"","Exchange":"NasdaqGS","Currency":"USD","Country":"United States","Sector":"Technology","Industry":"Software - Application","Address":"1441 West Innovation Way, Lehi, UT, 84043, United States","FiscalYearEnd":"","LatestQuarter":"","MarketCapitalization":"4155939840","EBITDA":"53742000","PERatio":"","PEGRatio":"","BookValue":"3.452","DividendPerShare":"","DividendYield":"","EPS":"-0.81","RevenuePerShareTTM":"20.025","ProfitMargin":"0.00829","OperatingMarginTTM":"0.05114","ReturnOnAssetsTTM":"0.02717","ReturnOnEquityTTM":"0.04479","RevenueTTM":"2734636032","GrossProfitTTM":"1194872960","DilutedEPSTTM":"-0.81","QuarterlyEarningsGrowthYOY":"0.281","QuarterlyRevenueGrowthYOY":"0.432","AnalystTargetPrice":"22.44444","TrailingPE":"","ForwardPE":"29.991838","PriceToSalesRatioTTM":"1.5197415","PriceToBookRatio":"6.066049","EVToRevenue":"1.218","EVToEBITDA":"62.001","Beta":"","52WeekHigh":"21.4","52WeekLow":"8.92","50DayMovingAverage":"15.6668","200DayMovingAverage":"14.088846","SharesOutstanding":"155063921","DividendDate":"","ExDividendDate":"","DebtToEquity":"5.096"},"daily":{"Meta Data":{"1. Information":"Daily Time Series (Yahoo Finance, shaped like Alpha Vantage)","2. Symbol":"PTRN","3. Last Refreshed":"2026-10-16","4. Output Size":"Compact"},"Time Series